usage: custody-pair.py verify [-h] [--live] receipt_a [receipt_b]

positional arguments:
  receipt_a   reference receipt
  receipt_b   candidate receipt

options:
  -h, --help  show this help message and exit
  --live      compare receipt_a against the live filesystem
exit=0
